", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Puiu9K/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f9bb1a46/uploads/origins/5d825661-3ad0-4a3b-877d-8163ced9584b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3008531b98be4ba53595e5010a61571f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f9bb1a46/uploads/origins/5d825661-3ad0-4a3b-877d-8163ced9584b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3008531b98be4ba53595e5010a61571f, https://si.imgix.net/f9bb1a46/uploads/origins/5d825661-3ad0-4a3b-877d-8163ced9584b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=543575a0cf0bd36e7ba5d6427417e739 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f9bb1a46/uploads/origins/5d825661-3ad0-4a3b-877d-8163ced9584b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c7f8f9e9b95ea57fa42fb55470167eae 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "｢エネルギッシュ･ユニフォーム(アナザー3)｣の衣装を着ている瑞希ちゃんのイラストをリクエストします。\nあさ子さんがいつも描いてるサイズで大丈夫です。\n\n髪型はポニーテール\nポーズ･背景等はおまかせします。\n\n以上、よろしくお願い致します🙇", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Puiu9K/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d467a7d6/uploads/origins/075e4320-a784-4ce5-8db9-91de9f647d62?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=36c933c32ec8ec5e99c058b915fabf87", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d467a7d6/uploads/origins/075e4320-a784-4ce5-8db9-91de9f647d62?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=36c933c32ec8ec5e99c058b915fabf87, https://si.imgix.net/d467a7d6/uploads/origins/075e4320-a784-4ce5-8db9-91de9f647d62?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=240ed29e5ba5fc8a072e472ff5225aa0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d467a7d6/uploads/origins/075e4320-a784-4ce5-8db9-91de9f647d62?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=82c3725f8d28a1b16d0c9dc6ca7f2af1 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、あさ子先生。\n\n背景、構図、髪型、服装、姿勢、顔の表情はあなた次第です。\n\nまた、背景を透明にしたデフを希望します。\n\nありがとうございました。\n\n\nyoutubeのライブやカバー、twitch、twitterに使用します。\n\nvtuberのtwitter。\nhttps://twitter.com/no15_rescute/media\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/19CTAwUGEqq6d7UW56v0ZpzqtiQ6HcNOj?usp=share_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Puiu9K/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f48da080/uploads/origins/9d696bbd-4b52-4168-9fb6-fd0cd70805ee?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c9de69a9a86fd098cc9e42e9b621f094", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f48da080/uploads/origins/9d696bbd-4b52-4168-9fb6-fd0cd70805ee?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c9de69a9a86fd098cc9e42e9b621f094, https://si.imgix.net/f48da080/uploads/origins/9d696bbd-4b52-4168-9fb6-fd0cd70805ee?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=743586aaabda753bd109aaf5f3fe6ef5 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f48da080/uploads/origins/9d696bbd-4b52-4168-9fb6-fd0cd70805ee?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f5cc9c65075ca058f15b9bca913554a3 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "はじめまして！\nあさ子様の絵がとても好きで、是非イラストを描いて頂きたいと思い、リクエストさせて頂きました。\n\n【希望デザイン】\n･赤色のツリ目、無表情\n･茶髪\n･ハーフツインヘア\n･前髪は正面から見て左側に流している\n･服装はお任せします！\n･ポーズや構造などは全てお任せします！\n\n希望デザインから自由に想像して描いて頂ければ大丈夫です！\n\nご検討よろしくお願いします！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Puiu9K/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/073b3dc8/uploads/origins/135d825e-72f5-4815-8dfa-62fe490ed436?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=56e5cd0d9276741955fa4d9a1da5ce6b", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/073b3dc8/uploads/origins/135d825e-72f5-4815-8dfa-62fe490ed436?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=56e5cd0d9276741955fa4d9a1da5ce6b, https://si.imgix.net/073b3dc8/uploads/origins/135d825e-72f5-4815-8dfa-62fe490ed436?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=64164716e6e9e3372cfd310935beae67 2x, https://si.imgix.net/073b3dc8/uploads/origins/135d825e-72f5-4815-8dfa-62fe490ed436?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bccfd3471b7782ad0f6903a1d1c885ae 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello, this is my first commission and I'm nervous!\nI've always wanted to commission a painting from Asako!\n\nRequest\nI don't know if it is legal to request an icon on Skeb, but may I request an icon?\nI would like to have an original character of Asako-san's image, like the hina doll maid that Asako-san drew!\n\nImage\nhttps://twitter.com/Puiu9K/status/1570666938677989378?s=20&t=zB-g3vM3EZjPYg0UypzZdA\n\nI'd like to ask her to wear a Japanese style maid's outfit, as that's what she prefers!\n\nUsage\nI would like to use them for icons on Twitter, YouTube, niconico, etc.!\n\nThat's all I ask!\nWe'll be rooting for you in all your future endeavors!\n\nhttps://twitter.com/Puiu9K/status/1570666938677989378?s=20&t=zB-g3vM3EZjPYg0UypzZdA", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Puiu9K/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ae6bd6f9/uploads/origins/73f233d8-2e6c-4175-9ebe-9c8edb8dcf57?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=efdce711d9a2f645bba3759a4015b020", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ae6bd6f9/uploads/origins/73f233d8-2e6c-4175-9ebe-9c8edb8dcf57?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=efdce711d9a2f645bba3759a4015b020, https://si.imgix.net/ae6bd6f9/uploads/origins/73f233d8-2e6c-4175-9ebe-9c8edb8dcf57?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4915eaa398c27e26e0dda8087600b18c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ae6bd6f9/uploads/origins/73f233d8-2e6c-4175-9ebe-9c8edb8dcf57?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a2195ec2563e7a4268a940898b123335 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Please give me a twi